      "filePath": "src/data/Perkbasedmg.ts",
      "summary": "Core perk damage definition module exporting PERK_DMG_DEFS, a data-driven array of 140+ PerkDmgDef entries (Springblast, Bastion Ballista, Gremlin Spirit, Ichor Spark, etc.) describing each perk's base damage, scaling, damage types, hit counts, proc coefficients, HP gates, and secondary effects, plus the PerkDmgDef/PerkDmgCtx/HpGate interfaces, HP-gate helpers, and the findPerkDmgDef lookup used by the damage calculator.",
      "tags": ["data-model", "type-definition", "game-data", "damage-calculator", "utility"],
      "complexity": "complex",
      "languageNotes": "Data-driven definition module: an exported const array of typed objects (PerkDmgDef) built from numeric constants in src/lib/constants.ts, with a lazily built Map keyed by perkName to power O(1) lookups."
